    },
    {
      "id": "07410554d195b0019b9e6f2977246a22bc4a3e518aa7bbd1c2cb203c5c693706",
      "text": "Topics",
      "hash": "e22820fcf5cd90e3fdd99a7569e0ee2f30eb7ebadfb2fe4d159b30c166ff81b7"
    },
    {
      "id": "8b9ef88bd2f14f7c7db938dbd1731efc9e4f9ba18bc12e49fad588274873b1d6",
      "text": "Tools & Environment",
      "hash": "cf9194302814cf2bb2ae04f0e1023fec3d18acdc5258a0e00c18bb7df366cf00"
    },
    {
      "id": "d1522999f0c4d2614389a409fcab9aae3582b3b3c9e900caa7ee6de81ea61c31",
      "text": "MCP",
      "hash": "53f13ae99ed53bd346eb8e1c8cefb7ef8260683b50401caf101360967ea052aa"
    },
    {
      "id": "f5efbeae1af410c4bfc2fa2f73c7674851b9bc622cd42d59152d79903aaeac1c",
      "text": "A protocol for plugging external tool servers into a harness — how an agent gets tools beyond what the harness ships with.",
      "hash": "c3c693fcdc6d9fbd9f640231d381a36d6b8371b3f23b1653c2d78e6c7ec51ed7"
    },
    {
      "id": "e6bd4b8b5c0f1ae6cf26f42f96ac89886782a47a79d7971d10addad4adaf4204",
      "text": "Matt Pocock",
      "hash": "2fe2c13509fbd45ec2578a74ef8efda313caad4f19533a102ca7d666ed60881d"
    },
    {
      "id": "ec62695e19600164c9dca04e25eb0c4fd2439700004d04ddea59c31b19b57db5",
      "text": "Copy page",
      "hash": "4104018941ae3ab016c117887a91b4f933f28e36c587b8983373fe9377ce34d7"
    },
    {
      "id": "ff98d63173ee09341b116b5ca4fc503f15c9352f48c06f820979814eda5cfb45",
      "text": "Model Context Protocol.",
      "hash": "a5472b338e2d5910c61f63492f83a22df71dc6da14cac9e03b1c042136f43a63"
    },
    {
      "id": "3e4099da7c70b5be6ab2cf3eafe409018146e6ce014dc5e2a0c877a77edbb45d",
      "text": "A protocol for plugging external tool servers into a",
      "hash": "00ed74fa92182c75ddfe46e4a0182d8a82b10f792bb0b9a7e7fb1b0e7b365303"
    },
    {
      "id": "133d1e4353bff693238ae8eb6b50a9a5a66b75bd156a0fab6ce6efdf05f819c7",
      "text": "— how an",
      "hash": "ed2f487ad9b67be68ba4ec791dd9e8964eb61fa3068039c8e7b0d7a47eeb5e67"
    },
    {
      "id": "c9a4326f895dd6ffdb42cbfea33c1ae48a4459f227dbca6a78a5a56b9e697c74",
      "text": "beyond what the harness ships with. The agent never \"calls MCP\"; it calls a tool, and the harness happens to have gotten that tool from an MCP server. Also exposes resources (read-only data) and prompts (reusable templates), but tool provision is the primary use.",
      "hash": "793ac3df8fc04010fbcc1deeb59b342adff152f1f5107776d961d436cfd33055"
    },
    {
      "id": "f414e0b892ddd0d9f31c46a95ccc282ffc0a150ed9bdde62b7adba580a18c668",
      "text": "The protocol solves an integration problem. Without a standard, every harness would need its own Linear integration, its own Slack integration, its own database integration — written and maintained separately for each. With MCP, the integration is written once as a server, and any MCP-compatible harness can use it. The harness connects to the server, the server advertises what tools it offers, and those tools become available to the agent alongside the built-in ones.",
      "hash": "07429cfb9855896fd49648e419edd8c68a6453ed2f471cd6b4dcfa457a33e796"
    },
    {
      "id": "a6bdaecc08d7fbd7135216cc68dbc7d30865aed0d45f763b221421ee3c7bc582",
      "text": "The cost is paid in",
      "hash": "c276dcef440bf4dff87219388c89edb7f0e3342f8b1ef71cc6fb8f795f33fbe7"
    },
    {
      "id": "ed4ca697b362850017581f199487c47bd5cff3421425a9bedbed372f1aea2242",
      "text": ". Every tool a server advertises arrives as a definition — name, description, parameter schema — and the",
      "hash": "c85b3065ceb35d4e585f324c9abfb8213687aad4f76ba199e0416188d49c4532"
    },
    {
      "id": "c531fe2ecdc49c209657efcf0bc4f696fa0f224e271e7ec04269bb2fb292c7d4",
      "text": "can only call tools it knows about. The naive approach loads every definition into the",
      "hash": "2535a925c249e98e56ab74f05e02fc1d7dead9ad3d2fb59ce19acd2eec9012d0"
    },
    {
      "id": "13216f9d3b02a3ef2cbade17eaf17f6ee71fbc4d2e939eac1dd5161c6a9ff0b5",
      "text": "context window",
      "hash": "6764434518d37f01df452fe2af0af3f314f8c27a72519001ea14189c5ee42476"
    },
    {
      "id": "9bf39d3608aa938c3e6955a383de075911b2a835a45e7a432587c320fda587e2",
      "text": "up front: install a few generous servers and a",
      "hash": "389979988187a47fa2d469f3d9d592bf6b0a29b1a1b2018b2cfca1e2cd5cbbde"
    },
    {
      "id": "d853c61b5426c1958d097cd590fdd4f167d773315dd7e982f0b3b948b9f3b10e",
      "text": "starts with thousands of",
      "hash": "0f25d51d0958efe8e3f063fb1ea944f9c5de929265b6744e6a61dfc714858e7d"
    },
    {
      "id": "2d6f9c503ae0d913a664c9972620b0680bbaeeff8e0d14c162837c1c38db67a5",
      "text": "of tool schemas before you've typed anything, spending",
      "hash": "b3241461a4a0832df40b7218d2565aea1ed6aca85f3a6b0360a1ca2c095f2d2b"
    },
    {
      "id": "4ed2cbd54c71a73a3680cd84b50768e490c0924379376a31c8d156581355df31",
      "text": "attention budget",
      "hash": "4f0ecd6ea97f18771cbd4203a929018449d8dbd4c6cce6f90fd7511b5c34cc81"
    },
    {
      "id": "aa9fe192280d789c3b31c0288ed1e25f00704345c9751219afc23c1c1823c80c",
      "text": "on tools the task will never use.",
      "hash": "c541ff228bcfc0653ca22394c7bf73c6be71f1a468bea444dff7fbe44ce6a38a"
    },
    {
      "id": "dfbb028184ec2a5247799cc83f1dc73780e54257c769205fce7cddf6b6cf7988",
      "text": "Many harnesses now mitigate this with tool search: instead of the full definitions, the context holds a",
      "hash": "04e1397fac4e68cfe0ffe9a6889e5a09a6192ec75c540e1d92d098e32560bcc4"
    },
    {
      "id": "3275fe6baae358686849b6f6ab81a8754cafe2a7e006e61246578e988c92ab64",
      "text": "context pointer",
      "hash": "7fb80893d92cf9accaa94f3b2f011e80e1ed58eb0ec3e161e07b14e34c36ca1b"
    },
    {
      "id": "0fcd9c33b79d111684123696dbdf63c8c1a6ce7a6026b58609e83726746eb1bb",
      "text": "to the available tools — the agent searches for a tool by name or purpose and loads its definition only when it needs it. If your harness doesn't do this, the up-front cost still applies, and it's worth enabling only the servers a project actually needs.",
      "hash": "475e85eafeed5cc713e9d66dc95b6ae545a1a53e1aef1f5cdbdab9f4393d4aec"
    },
    {
      "id": "7b594b0b94bbef1a8a8c7ce05cd9e19e236df4f3454af4a15049a725cc596d12",
      "text": "Usage:",
      "hash": "2bad3eeaf33caffe3bc9b482b4934ed19eb4ec3614c12373e1a5c5f8948217da"
    },
    {
      "id": "b42ce1c5259b24a2942631d5f5a9d375ec586e2eee8c4ab64ffed45c325618f9",
      "text": "\"The agent needs to read tickets from Linear.\"",
      "hash": "104355515fd2426fd589c3c3363817be9f4e811d63b079ee495572e954e0517d"
    },
    {
      "id": "614758f6dd2777c88b123020a3814b4ebb24ed233d8f04478e37a66eeef4adb0",
      "text": "\"Configure the harness to use the Linear MCP server — it exposes the Linear API as tools the agent can call. Saves you writing custom tool wrappers.\"",
      "hash": "9864a034fd07cb9c6aa4f6eb232d665fffa2125a9cf3981b33e3ba12ca292519"
    },
    {
      "id": "c29bc57147b6efc45410a053859b2f50d465b159813496e7d61e50874622a9bb",
      "text": "Previous term",
      "hash": "735604aff9e8f2192b83df4905cfc8e395613e0ce05f8ca85a1d2d1d44fd59f3"
    },
    {
      "id": "592d506961754b82fa2e7e0217331830e274176f55cb5c58281aa6cb86195e74",
      "text": "Tool result",
      "hash": "9bb620efa692f707a302a5f42464015a54c20843e2f76f18a1542626b886bb91"
    },
    {
      "id": "b97667720db78d11cb2c836c5d85f50814aec6f5e6963158c9378c07583c4c41",
      "text": "Next term",
      "hash": "5219c7ebdc0e098aa6db6f09e405c1b17ab75f1082862906a872e10a16818f9e"
    },
    {
